 Gems\".\n\n5. Rasaratnasamuccayadīpikā: Another commentary. \"Dīpikā\" means \"illumination\". So \"Illumination of ...\". Classify: [\"commentary\", \"rasaśāstra\"]. Translation: \"Illumination of the Collection of Mercury and Gems\". Russian: \"Освещение Собрания ртути и драгоценных камней\".\n\n6. Rasaratnasamuccayaṭīkā: \"Ṭīkā\" is commentary. So \"Commentary on ...\". Classify: [\"commentary\", \"rasaśāstra\"]. English: \"Commentary on the Compendium of Mercury and Gems\". Russian: \"Комментарий к Собранию ртути и драгоценных камней\".\n\n7. Rasaratnākara: \"Mine of Mercury and Gems\". Alchemical. Classify: [\"rasaśāstra\"]. English: \"Mine of Mercury and Gems\". Russian: \"Рудник ртути и драгоценных камней\".\n\n8. Rasasaṃketakalikā: \"Rasa-saṃketa-kalikā\" - \"Bud of the conventions of Rasa\". Likely alchemy. Classify: [\"rasaśāstra\"]. English: \"Bud of the Signs of Rasa\". Russian: \"Бутон знаков расы\". Actually \"saṃketa\" means convention, sign. So \"Kalikā\" bud. So \"The Bud of the Conventions of Rasa\".\n\n9. Rasataraṅgiṇī: \"Waves of Rasa\". Alchemical. Classify: [\"rasaśāstra\"]. English: \"Waves of Rasa\". Russian: \"Волны расы\".\n\n10. Rasendracintāmaṇi: \"Rasendra-cintāmaṇi\" - \"Wishing-jewel of the lord of mercury\". Alchemical. Classify: [\"rasaśāstra\"]. English: \"Wishing-jewel of the Lord of Mercury\". Russian: \"Чинтамани владыки ртути\".\n\n11. Rasendracūḍāmaṇi: \"Crest-jewel of the lord of mercury\". Alchemical. Classify: [\"rasaśāstra\"]. English: \"Crest-jewel of the Lord of Mercury\". Russian: \"Венец владыки ртути\".\n\n12. Rasendrasārasaṃgraha: \"Compendium of the essence of the lord of mercury\". Alchemical. Classify: [\"rasaśāstra\"]. English: \"Compendium of the Essence of the Lord of Mercury\". Russian: \"Собрание сущности владыки ртути\".\n\n13. Rasikapriyā: This could be about aesthetics. \"Rasika\" means connoisseur. \"Priyā\" beloved. \"Beloved of the Connoisseur\". Possibly a work on poetics or music? There is a work \"Ra